(1) Move to adopt the tentative operating millage for FY 2027 as 5.0465, which is 3.66% higher than the rolled-back rate of 4.8685;
(2) Move to adopt the tentative 2004 Voted Debt millage rate for FY 2027 as 0.1890;
(3) Move to adopt the tentative 2026 Voted Debt millage rate for FY 2027 as 0.2890, for a combined total of 5.5245 mills;
(4) Move to adopt the FY 2027 tentative budget for the General Fund in the amount of $42,527,000; and
(5) Set date of hearing for Final Resolution to set the millage rates and adopt the FY 2027 budget for September 28, 2026.

(1) Move to adopt the tentative operating millage for FY 2026 as 5.0465, which is 3.55% higher than the rolled-back rate of 4.8737;
(2) Move to adopt the tentative voted debt millage rate for FY 2026 as 0.1960 for a combined total of 5.2425 mills;
(3) Move to adopt the tentative budget for the General Fund in the amount of $42,205,000; and
(4) Set date of hearing for Final Resolution to adopt the FY 2026 budget for September 22, 2025.
